        "content": "<p>xia-chao opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15060\">PR #15060</a> from <code>xia-chao:serve-logstream-write-permit</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>check-write tells a guest how many bytes it can hand to serve without blocking. Accepting a larger write breaks that promise, so the guest should learn at once that it wrote too much instead of having serve print data it was told it could not send, and the write should trap as the contract says.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
